{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "62", "x": 0.9042195477562772, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.029523700847358492, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 38-40", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15360198182160828, "w": 0.17887010939310047, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.18386064948090083, "w": 0.37804085168299323, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "38 What does the writer suggest about ABS in the fifth paragraph?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.25209087792618046, "w": 0.7010436168835223, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2804582704077637, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It is bound to make key decisions that are wrong.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.2804582704077637, "w": 0.49962254156694835, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3087886959246864, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It may reduce some of the appeal of the game.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3087886959246864, "w": 0.4758370085966149, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33711902713812775, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It will lead to the disappearance of human umpires.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.33711902713812775, "w": 0.5228033310972641, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3654493772122654, "w": 0.026209235693898627, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It may increase calls for the rules of baseball to be changed.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3654493772122654, "w": 0.6169879824350148, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "39 Morgan Sword says that the introduction of ABS", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.43204800454588044, "w": 0.5445731593976987, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4603783923414106, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was regarded as an experiment without a guaranteed outcome.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.4603783923414106, "w": 0.6466191294339607, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48873348764903535, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was intended to keep up with developments in other sports.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.48873348764903535, "w": 0.6091266765521227, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5169155172078203, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was a response to changing attitudes about the role of sport.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5169155172078203, "w": 0.6228335964636272, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5452459050033505, "w": 0.026209235693898627, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was an attempt to ensure baseball retained a young audience.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5452459050033505, "w": 0.6345247732583753, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "40 Why does the writer include the views of Noe and Russo?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6118445323369655, "w": 0.6319043251484587, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6401748824111031, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to show that attitudes to technology vary widely", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6401748824111031, "w": 0.49498636315589445, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6685423503354714, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to argue that people have unrealistic expectations of sport", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6685423503354714, "w": 0.6012653706692306, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.696872700409609, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to indicate that accuracy is not the same thing as enjoyment", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.696872700409609, "w": 0.615576982758276, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7252031259265317, "w": 0.026209235693898627, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to suggest that the number of baseball fansneeds to increase", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7252031259265317, "w": 0.6308964664056996, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}